Third-party text reproduced in LitUbik — NOT covered by the AGPL
================================================================================

The AGPL grant above covers LitUbik's own code. It does not extend to the
wording of the reporting guidelines and appraisal instruments below, which
LitUbik reproduces so that reviewers can fill them in. That wording remains the
work of its authors, reproduced here with attribution and under their own
terms. Anyone redistributing LitUbik — and in particular anyone offering it as
a commercial service — must check those terms for their own use.

