PRISMA 2020 and PRISMA-S — CC BY 4.0
    backend/app/services/reporting/checklists/prisma2020.py
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
The PRISMA 2020 checklist items are reproduced verbatim; the flow diagram
follows the PRISMA 2020 structure but is drawn by LitUbik from its own counts
(no template artwork is reproduced).

    Page MJ, McKenzie JE, Bossuyt PM, Boutron I, Hoffmann TC, Mulrow CD, et al.
    The PRISMA 2020 statement: an updated guideline for reporting systematic
    reviews. BMJ 2021;372:n71. https://doi.org/10.1136/bmj.n71

    Rethlefsen ML, Kirtley S, Waffenschmidt S, Ayala AP, Moher D, Page MJ, et al.
    PRISMA-S: an extension to the PRISMA statement for reporting literature
    searches in systematic reviews. Syst Rev 2021;10:39.
    https://doi.org/10.1186/s13643-020-01542-z

