Bibliographic and open-access APIs
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
LitUbik queries Crossref, OpenAlex, Semantic Scholar, PubMed/NCBI E-utilities,
Europe PMC, arXiv, HAL, DOAJ, OpenCitations, Unpaywall and OSF, plus Scopus,
IEEE Xplore, CORE, Lens, Springer Nature and Web of Science when the operator
supplies their own API key. Each service has its own terms of use; the
operator is responsible for honouring them. LitUbik identifies itself with the
contact address the operator configures (LITUBIK_CONTACT_EMAIL, or the global
Unpaywall e-mail) and sends none otherwise — never a placeholder address.
